sequenceDiagram
  participant A as GitHub Actions
  participant G as GHCR
  participant D as Dev environment
  participant Z as OWASP ZAP
  A->>G: Push image sha-sha (on merge to main)
  A->>D: Deploy image
  A->>D: Wait for health check
  A->>Z: Start baseline scan against DEV URL
  Z->>D: Crawl + attack
  Z-->>A: Report (SARIF / HTML)
  A->>A: Fail on high findings, upload report
